WEBVTT

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:14.570
They usually don't travel 
in groups like that.

00:00:15.840 --> 00:00:18.450
Lady Ariane! Are those...?!

00:00:18.690 --> 00:00:21.160
Right. They're wyverns.

00:00:21.160 --> 00:00:22.410
I thought as much!

00:00:23.500 --> 00:00:25.440
Those are actual, living wyverns!

00:00:27.560 --> 00:00:29.720
<i>Hi there. It's me, Arc.</i>

00:00:30.330 --> 00:00:32.180
<i>With Lady Chiyome's intel,</i>

00:00:32.180 --> 00:00:36.040
<i>we've learned that the kidnapped elves 
have been brought to the Holy Revlon Empire,</i>

00:00:36.040 --> 00:00:38.740
<i>so we're making our way there.</i>

00:00:41.780 --> 00:00:44.490
That explains why the Whispering Fowl is so reluctant to fly.

00:00:44.880 --> 00:00:48.060
We won't be able to 
contact Danka for a while.

00:00:48.850 --> 00:00:50.080
Well, in that case...

00:00:50.930 --> 00:00:53.520
Perhaps we should have them disperse?

00:00:53.520 --> 00:00:55.200
Disperse...?

00:01:02.120 --> 00:01:05.080
Arc, what are you doing?

00:01:09.810 --> 00:01:11.920
From the mid-tier Magus class...

00:01:12.720 --> 00:01:14.890
An area-of-effect lightning element spell...

00:01:19.410 --> 00:01:21.660
Lightning Damper!

00:01:19.470 --> 00:01:22.770
<b>Lightning
Damper</b>

00:01:41.400 --> 00:01:43.420
I believe that takes care of that.

00:01:47.120 --> 00:01:49.580
What's the matter, Lady Ariane?! Ponta?!

00:01:50.100 --> 00:01:51.790
What happened?

00:01:51.790 --> 00:01:56.160
Even Whispering Fowl? 
Did you all eat something spoiled?

00:01:56.160 --> 00:01:57.880
What's become of you all?!

00:01:57.420 --> 00:01:58.480
Oh?

00:03:33.440 --> 00:03:36.150
My ears are still ringing.

00:03:36.490 --> 00:03:40.110
I'd appreciate a warning before you 
use such massive magic next time.

00:03:42.080 --> 00:03:43.960
F-forgive me.

00:03:43.960 --> 00:03:46.880
I wasn't anticipating 
such a potent outcome.

00:03:48.810 --> 00:03:50.000
Well, it's fine.

00:03:50.000 --> 00:03:52.970
Let's move on to what comes next.

00:03:55.700 --> 00:03:58.300
The shortest route to the empire would

00:03:58.300 --> 00:04:03.750
be crossing the Xpitol River and then 
going through the Febient marshlands, but...

00:04:04.760 --> 00:04:07.240
There's very little marked regarding 
the border town of Kaysehk,

00:04:07.240 --> 00:04:09.980
or the routes to and from it.

00:04:12.180 --> 00:04:15.760
Lady Ariane, are you 
concerned about something?

00:04:17.360 --> 00:04:21.660
I've noticed it since Lady Chiyome 
brought us this information.

00:04:21.660 --> 00:04:25.000
It seems to me like you're reluctant 
to travel to the Empire.

00:04:26.520 --> 00:04:27.980
You're right.

00:04:28.370 --> 00:04:33.960
Unlike Rhoden, the capture of elves 
isn't illegal in the empire.

00:04:33.960 --> 00:04:38.320
Being an elf will be even more 
dangerous than it has been so far.

00:04:38.320 --> 00:04:42.000
Even being in a town closer to the border, 
like this one, is cause for caution.

00:04:42.000 --> 00:04:43.960
I admit, it makes me nervous.

00:04:44.460 --> 00:04:45.790
Got a moment?

00:04:46.680 --> 00:04:51.400
You two are responsible for that incredible 
magic in the desert this morning, yeah?

00:04:52.350 --> 00:04:53.860
Indeed we are.

00:04:53.860 --> 00:04:55.100
Who might you be?

00:04:55.360 --> 00:04:57.230
My name is Carcy.

00:04:57.230 --> 00:04:59.360
Carcy Held. It's a—

00:05:01.980 --> 00:05:06.860
What kind of elf would reveal their 
ears in the middle of a human town?!

00:05:07.620 --> 00:05:09.960
Lady Ariane, calm yourself!

00:05:10.320 --> 00:05:13.160
Carcy, will you be having your usual?

00:05:13.160 --> 00:05:15.740
I will, thanks!

00:05:16.870 --> 00:05:18.400
Coming up!

00:05:18.400 --> 00:05:21.580
It'll just be a moment.

00:05:21.580 --> 00:05:24.330
Hey, it's Carcy.

00:05:24.330 --> 00:05:26.040
Fancy a drink with us?

00:05:26.040 --> 00:05:27.860
I'll join you later.

00:05:29.000 --> 00:05:30.520
What's going on here?

00:05:30.980 --> 00:05:33.290
Could you let go first?

00:05:36.170 --> 00:05:38.850
I've taken a liking to this town, you see.

00:05:38.850 --> 00:05:41.400
And at this point everyone knows me.

00:05:42.100 --> 00:05:44.940
It's been ten years since I moved here.

00:05:44.940 --> 00:05:47.760
Ten years?! In a human town?

00:05:47.760 --> 00:05:50.650
How? That's...

00:05:50.650 --> 00:05:52.960
You're an elf...

00:05:52.960 --> 00:05:55.370
No, a dark elf, right?

00:05:56.320 --> 00:05:58.840
Not sure what you expect me to say.

00:05:58.840 --> 00:06:02.450
A world where humans 
and elves can co-exist...

00:06:02.450 --> 00:06:05.380
Who's to say that 
isn't the way things should be?

00:06:07.000 --> 00:06:08.770
You must be kidding!

00:06:08.770 --> 00:06:12.880
Do you realize what humans have done to us?!

00:06:14.020 --> 00:06:15.610
Well, you've got a point.

00:06:15.610 --> 00:06:17.560
But you're a dark elf,

00:06:17.560 --> 00:06:21.990
yet you're traveling 
with this human in the full plate.

00:06:21.990 --> 00:06:26.450
Add a spirit creature to the group, 
and it makes for quite a unique mix.

00:06:28.090 --> 00:06:29.740
Arc is...

00:06:29.740 --> 00:06:30.900
a special case.

00:06:31.970 --> 00:06:33.120
Now then,

00:06:33.370 --> 00:06:37.450
Sir Carcy, what is it 
that you wanted with us?

00:06:37.450 --> 00:06:38.750
Right.

00:06:38.750 --> 00:06:42.190
I make my living studying 
the biology of monsters.

00:06:42.700 --> 00:06:43.590
And lately,

00:06:43.590 --> 00:06:46.800
some of the specimens I've been looking 
into have proven troublesome.

00:06:47.200 --> 00:06:50.920
You'd like our aid 
in capturing them, in other words?

00:06:50.920 --> 00:06:52.840
You're a sharp one.

00:06:52.840 --> 00:06:55.960
And I believe the two of you 
are strong enough to do it.

00:06:55.960 --> 00:06:59.600
Worst-case scenario, you'd only need 
to recover the bodies.

00:06:59.600 --> 00:07:04.230
Unfortunately, we've got a more 
pressing matter to attend to.

00:07:04.690 --> 00:07:06.840
How's this strike you as payment?

00:07:07.710 --> 00:07:08.960
What is that?

00:07:08.960 --> 00:07:11.630
A map of the Holy Revlon Empire.

00:07:12.260 --> 00:07:13.840
Were you eavesdropping?!

00:07:13.840 --> 00:07:16.410
You need it, don't you?

00:07:16.700 --> 00:07:20.880
Lady Ariane, a map showing us the way 
to the empire would prove useful...

00:07:22.370 --> 00:07:26.080
I can throw in a copy of my 
book on monster studies, as well.

00:07:27.060 --> 00:07:30.400
Lady Ariane! I sincerely want that!

00:07:30.690 --> 00:07:33.100
What do you say? Can we?

00:07:33.100 --> 00:07:34.610
What do you say?!

00:07:34.610 --> 00:07:35.950
Fine...

00:07:35.950 --> 00:07:38.460
Yes! Let's do it! Leave it to us!

00:07:38.460 --> 00:07:41.070
I thought you'd see things my way.

00:07:41.070 --> 00:07:45.310
We'll set out tomorrow morning
from the town entrance.

00:07:45.310 --> 00:07:46.580
I'm looking forward to it.

00:07:47.780 --> 00:07:49.750
Sorry about the delay!

00:07:50.260 --> 00:07:52.280
There you are, Carcy!

00:07:52.280 --> 00:07:53.750
Hope you're ready to drink!

00:07:53.750 --> 00:07:54.910
'Scuse me!

00:07:58.620 --> 00:08:01.660
Will five gold coins cover our lodgings?

00:08:01.660 --> 00:08:04.430
Wha... One is plenty!

00:08:04.430 --> 00:08:07.050
Give me a second, and I'll get your change.

00:08:07.050 --> 00:08:09.990
No, Madam, please keep it.

00:08:10.500 --> 00:08:11.510
But in exchange,

00:08:11.510 --> 00:08:14.840
I'd appreciate being allowed to 
take my food to my room...

00:08:15.010 --> 00:08:16.650
Of course!

00:08:16.650 --> 00:08:18.810
In fact, I've got something special for you.

00:08:20.550 --> 00:08:22.240
Take the whole barrel.

00:08:22.240 --> 00:08:26.040
It's good stuff, and should suit 
even a fine knight like yourself.

00:08:26.040 --> 00:08:28.640
Oh, much obliged!

00:08:32.470 --> 00:08:37.500
Elves and humans co-existing, huh?

00:08:39.300 --> 00:08:41.640
You seem to have trouble accepting it.

00:08:41.640 --> 00:08:43.280
A bit, yeah.

00:08:43.610 --> 00:08:48.180
When I think about what humans 
have done to us so far...

00:08:49.250 --> 00:08:52.880
I doubt pondering the issue 
in this moment will provide an answer.

00:08:54.470 --> 00:08:57.340
Oh, this smells lovely!

00:08:58.690 --> 00:09:00.930
And pretty strong.

00:09:00.930 --> 00:09:02.730
No need to force yourself.

00:09:02.730 --> 00:09:04.760
There's fruit juice, as well.

00:09:05.240 --> 00:09:07.940
D-Do not treat me like a child!

00:09:07.940 --> 00:09:09.530
It's just some liquor!

00:09:14.870 --> 00:09:16.110
How's that?!

00:09:16.110 --> 00:09:19.600
Oh, drunk like a champion!

00:09:19.600 --> 00:09:21.450
And I'm ready for more, too!

00:09:21.450 --> 00:09:24.020
Ah, I apologize for the delay, then.

00:09:33.010 --> 00:09:36.030
<i>Does she not realize she's doing 
that with her ears...?</i>

00:09:37.930 --> 00:09:39.520
Allow me to join you.

00:09:41.980 --> 00:09:44.900
<i>There's a volume to its sweetness,</i>

00:09:44.900 --> 00:09:47.330
<i>as well a hint of vanilla aroma!</i>

00:09:47.330 --> 00:09:49.710
<i>Even a single sip is joyful...</i>

00:09:51.450 --> 00:09:53.530
Truly delicious!

00:09:53.530 --> 00:09:55.800
Although, a bit on the strong side.

00:09:56.840 --> 00:09:59.060
Arrrc....

00:10:00.760 --> 00:10:01.910
Lady Ariane?!

00:10:02.820 --> 00:10:05.310
Arrrc...

00:10:12.880 --> 00:10:14.300
Hey...

00:10:14.790 --> 00:10:16.250
Give me some.

00:10:17.140 --> 00:10:20.210
I... want... more....

00:10:21.380 --> 00:10:24.940
Lady Ariane, was two glasses all it took?!

00:10:25.170 --> 00:10:28.640
Are you listening, Arc?!

00:10:28.640 --> 00:10:30.610
She's totally hammered!

00:10:33.780 --> 00:10:38.200
What even ish "a world where elvsh 
and humansh can live together"?!

00:10:38.430 --> 00:10:40.900
<i>That really did get to her!</i>

00:10:41.300 --> 00:10:45.360
Lady Ariane, perhaps you've 
had enough for tonight...

00:10:45.360 --> 00:10:49.710
Whachu shay to me, you shtupid bonehead?!

00:10:49.710 --> 00:10:51.550
What'sh dat, baldie?!

00:10:52.000 --> 00:10:54.160
Oh, my...

00:10:54.880 --> 00:10:59.270
Elvsh and humansh living together?!

00:10:59.270 --> 00:11:01.480
Shyeah right!

00:11:12.270 --> 00:11:18.040
Huh... I think I was drinking with Arc...

00:11:19.200 --> 00:11:20.720
And then...

00:11:21.570 --> 00:11:23.300
Ow, my head...

00:11:29.820 --> 00:11:31.550
A skeleton!

00:11:33.200 --> 00:11:35.150
W-Wait, Lady Ariane!

00:11:35.150 --> 00:11:39.200
I call upon the flames 
to rain down upon our foes!

00:11:43.370 --> 00:11:45.430
Good morning.

00:11:45.430 --> 00:11:47.760
Did you two enjoy yourselves last night?

00:11:48.700 --> 00:11:50.600
Nothing happened...

00:11:50.600 --> 00:11:53.240
Nothing happened, right?!

00:11:54.880 --> 00:11:56.990
You know, proprietress...

00:11:56.990 --> 00:12:00.830
There is little as fearsome 
as a woman freed from restraint.

00:12:03.600 --> 00:12:05.520
Oh, you!

00:12:13.290 --> 00:12:15.730
I apologize for our tardiness, Sir Carcy.

00:12:16.960 --> 00:12:19.040
Hey, good morning.

00:12:19.040 --> 00:12:24.000
Arc, Ariane, you two will be 
joining me in the lead wagon.

00:12:24.000 --> 00:12:26.630
The rear one will carry my friend.

00:12:27.440 --> 00:12:28.560
Understood.

00:12:28.880 --> 00:12:32.720
You two were certainly 
rather intense last night.

00:12:32.720 --> 00:12:34.920
The entire town heard you.

00:12:37.030 --> 00:12:38.130
I could kill him...

00:12:38.130 --> 00:12:40.990
Lady Ariane!

00:12:40.990 --> 00:12:46.000
Episode 10

00:12:40.990 --> 00:12:46.000
Hope for the Future Found in the Desert

00:12:57.930 --> 00:13:00.870
It seems the combination of a hangover 
and motion sickness is devastating...

00:13:01.790 --> 00:13:07.920
And the smell coming 
from the cart is just making it worse.

00:13:07.920 --> 00:13:11.330
Sir Carcy, what is being 
hauled in that cart?

00:13:11.330 --> 00:13:13.640
Oh, that...

00:13:14.120 --> 00:13:16.110
Goblin carcasses.

00:13:16.400 --> 00:13:19.720
We'll be using those as bait 
for the sand worm.

00:13:19.720 --> 00:13:22.500
The stronger the stench, 
the more effective it will be.

00:13:23.320 --> 00:13:25.460
And this sand worm creature...

00:13:26.000 --> 00:13:28.140
Right, it's what we're trying to capture.

00:13:29.750 --> 00:13:31.040
Sir Knight!

00:13:32.790 --> 00:13:34.750
That tea sobers folks right up.

00:13:34.750 --> 00:13:38.460
Works wonders with hangovers 
and motion sickness, as well.

00:13:38.460 --> 00:13:40.880
Oh, my thanks.

00:13:47.780 --> 00:13:50.920
Still nervous around humans, Ariane?

00:13:50.920 --> 00:13:52.840
I wouldn't exactly say that.

00:13:52.840 --> 00:13:54.530
You can relax.

00:13:54.530 --> 00:13:57.980
He might look sinister, 
but he's a good person.

00:13:58.280 --> 00:14:00.590
Real nice, Carcy!

00:14:00.590 --> 00:14:03.240
Don't expect any more tea from me!

00:14:04.280 --> 00:14:05.880
Sorry, sorry.

00:14:07.300 --> 00:14:08.450
Lady Ariane.

00:14:18.650 --> 00:14:20.040
It's good.

00:14:28.400 --> 00:14:29.990
I must ask, Sir Carcy.

00:14:30.730 --> 00:14:34.650
I'd like to know more about this sand worm.

00:14:34.650 --> 00:14:36.870
Right, good point.

00:14:36.870 --> 00:14:39.600
The one that I'm tracking right now...

00:14:40.390 --> 00:14:42.840
It's about four to five meters long.

00:14:42.840 --> 00:14:45.150
During the day, it rests deep underground,

00:14:45.150 --> 00:14:49.610
and in the evening and night 
it surfaces to scavenge corpses.

00:14:49.610 --> 00:14:51.720
It's weak to flame, incidentally,

00:14:51.720 --> 00:14:54.320
but since we're trying to capture it,

00:14:54.320 --> 00:14:58.190
I'd like to avoid using 
fire as much as possible.

00:14:59.270 --> 00:15:03.040
Another thing I've discovered recently

00:15:03.040 --> 00:15:06.240
is that it tends to gravitate 
towards flocks of wyverns.

00:15:08.270 --> 00:15:11.900
<i>Then it may have been 
nearby earlier as well.</i>

00:15:13.370 --> 00:15:16.300
I'm certain if I can learn more 
about it during this expedition,

00:15:16.300 --> 00:15:19.050
we'll be able to prevent it from 
causing as many casualties in the future.

00:15:19.650 --> 00:15:22.550
That's the reason I study monsters.

00:15:23.440 --> 00:15:24.940
Magnificent!

00:15:24.940 --> 00:15:28.100
I would love to hear what you 
have learned about other monsters.

00:15:29.040 --> 00:15:30.560
It'd be my pleasure...

00:15:30.560 --> 00:15:32.530
What kind has caught your fancy?

00:15:31.180 --> 00:15:32.900
Ridiculous...

00:15:32.530 --> 00:15:33.560
Ah, where to begin?

00:15:33.560 --> 00:15:37.940
Is there anything big, but fast, that can fly, 
that shines like metal, that can breathe fire?!

00:15:35.120 --> 00:15:36.940
Where've the cart and the other wagon gone?!

00:15:37.260 --> 00:15:39.850
Carcy, the wagons are gone!

00:15:37.940 --> 00:15:39.950
Well, that sounds like...

00:15:39.850 --> 00:15:41.080
What?!

00:15:46.200 --> 00:15:48.270
H-How is this four to five meters?!

00:15:48.270 --> 00:15:50.360
It's easily 30, at least.

00:15:50.360 --> 00:15:51.110
Impossible...

00:15:51.720 --> 00:15:55.050
I've never seen a specimen this huge before!

00:15:57.710 --> 00:15:58.520
This is bad!

00:15:58.960 --> 00:15:59.850
Lady Ariane!

00:16:00.120 --> 00:16:01.050
Stay back!

00:16:02.760 --> 00:16:05.610
Fire, I implore you.

00:16:07.420 --> 00:16:09.160
Surge from this sword, and burst forth!

00:16:12.900 --> 00:16:16.290
It can't be... It's supposed
to be weak against fire!

00:16:16.290 --> 00:16:17.740
That had no effect all!

00:16:18.840 --> 00:16:19.520
No—

00:16:24.330 --> 00:16:26.840
Are you all right, Lady Ariane?

00:16:26.840 --> 00:16:28.110
Arc!

00:16:30.130 --> 00:16:31.760
Leave the rest to me.

00:16:31.760 --> 00:16:33.300
Hurry and get him to safety!

00:16:33.520 --> 00:16:34.340
Right!

00:16:43.070 --> 00:16:44.750
Quite the powerful beast.

00:16:46.430 --> 00:16:49.360
Arc, we're all in the clear!

00:16:49.660 --> 00:16:51.200
Understood!

00:16:52.100 --> 00:16:53.160
Now, then...

00:16:53.640 --> 00:16:55.850
It's time for a test of strength.

00:16:56.740 --> 00:16:58.240
This is bad.

00:16:58.240 --> 00:17:00.240
He can't draw his sword in that position.

00:17:20.780 --> 00:17:22.070
Bloody hell...

00:17:23.080 --> 00:17:24.910
He swung it around...

00:17:24.910 --> 00:17:27.420
That is... impressive.

00:17:29.020 --> 00:17:32.280
Hey, will that do?

00:17:32.700 --> 00:17:35.520
More than sufficient, yes.

00:17:41.930 --> 00:17:43.800
Here's the reward you were promised.

00:17:45.340 --> 00:17:46.760
This is it!

00:17:46.760 --> 00:17:48.940
You've been a huge help.

00:17:48.940 --> 00:17:52.590
I hate to think what would've happened 
if I hadn't run into you two.

00:17:52.590 --> 00:17:55.580
I'm glad we were able to help.

00:17:55.580 --> 00:17:58.590
I suppose that brings 
this matter to a close.

00:17:58.850 --> 00:18:01.330
Well, let us set out, Lady Ariane.

00:18:03.050 --> 00:18:04.360
Lady Ariane...?

00:18:06.060 --> 00:18:08.230
Can I ask you something?

00:18:10.120 --> 00:18:13.440
Why do you live among humans?

00:18:16.150 --> 00:18:18.280
Because I love them, I suppose.

00:18:18.280 --> 00:18:20.990
You love... humans?

00:18:20.990 --> 00:18:21.900
Right.

00:18:22.660 --> 00:18:25.380
I'll admit, when I lived in an elf village,

00:18:25.380 --> 00:18:28.590
I didn't have the best impression of them.

00:18:29.430 --> 00:18:31.960
But once I started living among them,

00:18:31.960 --> 00:18:33.640
they were different from what I imagined.

00:18:34.320 --> 00:18:36.520
Not to say it's always been easy, but...

00:18:37.830 --> 00:18:40.050
This is how I feel now:

00:18:40.050 --> 00:18:45.520
A time will come where humans 
and elves can live hand-in-hand.

00:18:47.980 --> 00:18:51.480
I can't really imagine a future like that.

00:18:51.480 --> 00:18:52.690
Really?

00:18:52.690 --> 00:18:55.600
You haven't heard about Lamburt, then?

00:18:55.600 --> 00:18:56.920
Lamburt?

00:18:57.440 --> 00:19:00.960
It's a port city in 
the west of the Rhoden Kingdom.

00:19:01.220 --> 00:19:03.410
What about it?

00:19:03.410 --> 00:19:05.750
This is news that I heard the other day...

00:19:06.340 --> 00:19:10.620
The lord of Lamburt 
took an elf as his bride.

00:19:15.210 --> 00:19:17.840
How is that possible?! Is it coercion?!

00:19:17.840 --> 00:19:19.840
She's being forced to marry him, isn't she?!

00:19:20.080 --> 00:19:24.960
No, she was on the verge of being sold 
into slavery when the lord set her free.

00:19:24.960 --> 00:19:27.670
And since then, they've developed 
feelings for each other, apparently.

00:19:31.710 --> 00:19:33.490
They've spoken about

00:19:34.210 --> 00:19:41.660
how they'd like to work to improve 
relations between humans and elves.

00:19:49.860 --> 00:19:51.160
Say, Arc...

00:19:51.880 --> 00:19:54.520
That kind of future, for elves and humans...

00:19:55.050 --> 00:19:56.980
Do you think it's really possible?

00:19:57.600 --> 00:19:58.720
Who can say?

00:19:59.380 --> 00:20:04.100
But the individuals who make up both races 
are numerous, with their own thoughts and opinions.

00:20:04.100 --> 00:20:08.790
Perhaps not collectively, but many among 
both may choose co-existence one day...

00:20:09.930 --> 00:20:12.010
Much like we have.

00:20:14.000 --> 00:20:18.110
You hardly look like a human, 
so I'd say you don't count, Arc!

00:20:18.110 --> 00:20:22.030
Well, despite appearances, 
I do consider myself to be one.

00:20:23.900 --> 00:20:26.880
Why would you deny that, Ponta?!

00:20:33.520 --> 00:20:38.680
I'd heard there were a number 
of disappearances in town lately...

00:20:38.680 --> 00:20:40.760
I take it that's your doing.

00:20:40.760 --> 00:20:45.240
I've only been using crooks 
and slaves as feed for them, haven't I?

00:20:45.240 --> 00:20:46.840
Well, mostly.

00:20:47.100 --> 00:20:49.430
Y-you're going too far...

00:20:50.040 --> 00:20:51.450
Sir Fumba!

00:20:51.450 --> 00:20:52.140
Aw...

00:20:52.140 --> 00:20:55.600
A-And this place is supposed to be a secret,

00:20:55.600 --> 00:20:58.860
yet you bring these whores 
here to... fraternize?

00:20:58.860 --> 00:21:00.800
What were you thinking?!

00:21:01.620 --> 00:21:02.650
Oh...

00:21:02.920 --> 00:21:05.660
I get my work done, don't I?

00:21:05.660 --> 00:21:08.270
Emperor Domitianus won't mind if I—

00:21:07.570 --> 00:21:09.610
S-such impudence!

00:21:09.610 --> 00:21:11.880
Do not speak His Imperial Highness's name!

00:21:11.880 --> 00:21:13.940
Oh, sorry about that.

00:21:13.940 --> 00:21:18.950
Still, you lot are the ones 
who wanted my help, right?

00:21:20.920 --> 00:21:23.920
And what of our planned attack?

00:21:26.860 --> 00:21:28.240
Walk this way.

00:21:38.230 --> 00:21:40.600
They're looking a bit hungry, I'd say.

00:21:42.120 --> 00:21:44.860
No!

00:21:50.470 --> 00:21:52.780
No—

00:21:53.600 --> 00:21:56.920
Don't eat so fast.

00:21:56.920 --> 00:22:00.000
You'll get bones stuck 
in your throats, you hear?

00:23:39.980 --> 00:23:44.980
Next Time

00:23:39.980 --> 00:23:44.980
The Monster-Taming Barbarian Laughs in the Darkness

00:23:44.980 --> 00:23:49.990
<b>Always remember: you can drink liquor, but don't drown in it.
#DrinkResponsibly #HangingWithPonta</b>
